ַ</span> <a data-ref=\"I Samuel 1:13\" href=\"/I_Samuel.1.13\">1 S 1:13</a>, <span dir=\"rtl\">נִיד</span> <a data-ref=\"Job 16:5\" href=\"/Job.16.5\">Jb 16:5</a>. †(3) transition to meaning <em>speech</em>, <span dir=\"rtl\">עָלָה עַל־שְׂפַת לָשׁוֹן</span> <a data-ref=\"Ezekiel 36:3\" href=\"/Ezekiel.36.3\">Ez 36:3</a>; = ability to speak <a data-ref=\"Job 12:20\" href=\"/Job.12.20\">Jb 12:20</a>."}],"num":"a."},{"senses":[{"definition":"organ of laughter <a data-ref=\"Job 8:21\" href=\"/Job.8.21\">Jb 8:21</a>."}],"all_cited":true,"num":"b."},{"senses":[{"definition":"of insulting grimace <span dir=\"rtl\">הִפְטִיר בְּשׂ׳</span> <a data-ref=\"Psalms 22:8\" href=\"/Psalms.22.8\">ψ 22:8</a>."}],"all_cited":true,"num":"c."},{"senses":[{"definition":"quivering in terror <a data-ref=\"Habakkuk 3:16\" href=\"/Habakkuk.3.16\">Hb 3:16</a>."}],"all_cited":true,"num":"d."},{"senses":[{"definition":"feature of beauty <a data-ref=\"Song of Songs 4:3\" href=\"/Song_of_Songs.4.3\">Ct 4:3</a> (scarlet)."}],"all_cited":true,"num":"e."},{"senses":[{"definition":"place of bridle <a data-ref=\"II Kings 19:28\" href=\"/II_Kings.19.28\">2 K 19:28</a> = <a data-ref=\"Isaiah 37:29\" href=\"/Isaiah.37.29\">Is 37:29</a> (v. <a data-ref=\"BDB, מֶ֫תֶג\" href=\"/BDB,_מֶ֫תֶג\", dir=\"rtl\">מֶתֶג</a>)"}],"num":"f."},{"senses":[{"definition":"receiving kiss <a data-ref=\"Proverbs 24:26\" href=\"/Proverbs.24.26\">Pr 24:26</a> cf. <a data-ref=\"Song of Songs 4:11\" href=\"/Song_of_Songs.4.11\">Ct 4:11</a> and (in fig.) <a data-ref=\"Song of Songs 7:10\" href=\"/Song_of_Songs.7.10\">7:10</a>."}],"all_cited":true,"num":"g."},{"senses":[{"definition":"of divine speech, <span dir=\"rtl\">מִצְוִת שׂ׳</span> <a data-ref=\"Job 23:12\" href=\"/Job.23.12\">Jb 23:12</a>, <span dir=\"rtl\">דְּבַר שׂ׳</span> <a data-ref=\"Psalms 17:4\" href=\"/Psalms.17.4\">ψ 17:4</a>."}],"all_cited":true,"num":"h."}],"num":"1."},{"senses":[{"definition":"<em>language</em> (v. <a data-ref=\"BDB, לָשׁוֹן\" href=\"/BDB,_לָשׁוֹן